                "keywords": "baldwin 6939, BAL-6939, Baldwin Barclay entrance sets, baldwin Barclay entrysets, rope entry sets, traditional entry sets, solid brass entrysets, mortise entrysets, mortise entrance sets, mortise handlesets, single cylinder entrance sets, double cylinder entrance sets, traditional front door hardware, baldwin estate collection entry sets, baldwin estates collection entrance sets, rope handlesets, rope levers, baldwin ornate entrance sets,"
